
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - James Mallory.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - James Mallory.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"d4y7no","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777002481292,"size":4082,"at":1777331817921,"hash":"d4y7no"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,17],"#Characters - James Mallory":[19,36],"#Characters - James Mallory#{1}":[21,36]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":55,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["James","Mallory","guards","Guard"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**James Mallory Summary:**  \n- **What:** Professional killer & commander of Cassia County Militia. A \"Redeemed Warlord\" – former criminal and pillager now loyal to the Claymore/Blakeney household. Branded with 'R' for 'Robber'.  \n- **When selected:** Any scenario involving military threats, violent conflict, rebellion, or protection of Cassia County; also social friction with aristocratic norms or Captain Eva; moments where pragmatic brutality or understated dark humor is needed.  \n- **Key relationships:** Loyal to Charlotte Claymore (reawakened his conscience), Florence Claymore (warmth), and {{user}} (unexpected respect). Holds disgust for Loren’s cruelty. Tension with Captain Eva over command style. Works as blunt instrument for peace through intimidation."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - James Mallory.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1i9no7v","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - James Mallory.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,17],"size":957,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
